  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759825,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 16 BIT XMAS 2012: Snowball Fight - Super Nintendo Entertainment System\n\nEmbrace the holiday spirit with *Snowball Fight*, a frantic and festive four-player battle for Super Nintendo supremacy! Developed by RetroZone, this game captures the joy and playful chaos of a winter wonderland snowball fight. Gather your three best friends and prepare for a blizzard blast of laughter and friendly competition.\n\nForget peaceful caroling – this is a full-on snowball war! Dodge incoming snowballs, strategically target your opponents, and revel in the satisfying sting of a perfectly aimed hit. Experience the cozy warmth of the holiday season juxtaposed with the exhilarating thrill of a snowball ambush. \n\n*Snowball Fight* delivers vibrant, colorful graphics and playful sound effects, perfectly evoking the magic of Christmas. Whether you're dodging aliens and collecting presents (a nod to RetroZone's earlier *Christmas Craze*) or simply enjoying the thrill of payback against a \"freckle-faced neighbor,\" *Snowball Fight* is the ultimate holiday gaming experience. Prepare for a flurry of fun!"
    },
